      <string>&lt;b&gt;Linear&lt;/b&gt; – straight wedge, like a trapezoid&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Quad&lt;/b&gt; – soft bend&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cubic&lt;/b&gt; (default) – noticeable neck: wide on top, narrows sharply near the icon&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Quart, Quint&lt;/b&gt; – even sharper: wide body, thin tail&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sine&lt;/b&gt; – smooth S-shape, close to the classic genie effect&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Circ&lt;/b&gt; – bend along a circular arc, bulging sides&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Bounce&lt;/b&gt; – wavy, springy sides&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Bezier&lt;/b&gt; – smooth S-curve, softer at both ends</string>
